message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Data AI Chatbot"
abstract: >
  A full-stack AI chatbot application that provides natural-language access to World Bank
  development data via the Data360 MCP Server, with support for data retrieval, chart
  generation, document creation, and Proof-Carrying Numbers (PCN) verification of numeric claims.
